{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\u200b\\u3000\\-\u3001\u3002\uff0c\uff0e\uff1f\uff01\uff1b]+","pipeline":["stemmer"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Welcome to MkDocs","text":"<p>For full documentation visit mkdocs.org.</p>"},{"location":"#commands","title":"Commands","text":"<ul> <li><code>mkdocs new [dir-name]</code> - Create a new project.</li> <li><code>mkdocs serve</code> - Start the live-reloading docs server.</li> <li><code>mkdocs build</code> - Build the documentation site.</li> <li><code>mkdocs -h</code> - Print help message and exit.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"#project-layout","title":"Project layout","text":"<pre><code>mkdocs.yml    # The configuration file.\ndocs/\n    index.md  # The documentation homepage.\n    ...       # Other markdown pages, images and other files.\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"blog/tags/","title":"\u5206\u7c7b","text":""},{"location":"blog/tags/#tags","title":"Tags","text":""},{"location":"blog/2026/07/09/%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%BA%A6%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/","title":"\u590d\u6742\u5ea6\u5206\u6790","text":""},{"location":"blog/2026/07/09/%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%BA%A6%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/#1","title":"1 \u4e24\u79cd\u57fa\u672c\u7684\u7a0b\u5e8f\u63a7\u5236\u7ed3\u6784","text":""},{"location":"blog/2026/07/09/%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%BA%A6%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/#11","title":"1.1 \u8fed\u4ee3","text":"<p>\u8fed\u4ee3(Iteration)\u662f\u4e00\u79cd\u91cd\u590d\u6267\u884c\u67d0\u4e2a\u4efb\u52a1\u7684\u63a7\u5236\u7ed3\u6784\u3002\u5728\u8fed\u4ee3\u4e2d\uff0c\u7a0b\u5e8f\u4f1a\u5728\u6ee1\u8db3\u4e00\u5b9a\u7684\u6761\u4ef6\u4e0b\u91cd\u590d\u6267\u884c\u67d0\u6bb5\u4ee3\u7801\uff0c\u76f4\u5230\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6761\u4ef6\u4e0d\u518d\u6ee1\u8db3\u3002</p>"},{"location":"blog/2026/07/09/%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%BA%A6%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/#111","title":"1.1.1 \u5e38\u89c1\u7684\u8fed\u4ee3\u5f62\u5f0f","text":""},{"location":"blog/2026/07/09/%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%BA%A6%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/#1111-for","title":"1.1.1.1 <code>for\u5faa\u73af</code>","text":"<p><code>for\u5faa\u73af</code>\u662f\u6700\u5e38\u89c1\u7684\u8fed\u4ee3\u5f62\u5f0f\u4e4b\u4e00\uff0c\u9002\u5408\u9884\u5148\u77e5\u9053\u8fed\u4ee3\u6b21\u6570\u65f6\u4f7f\u7528\u3002</p> <p>\u4e0b\u9762\u7684\u4ee3\u7801\u4e3a\u4e00\u4e2a\u5229\u7528<code>for\u5faa\u73af</code>\u5b9e\u73b0\u67d0\u9879\u529f\u80fd\u7684\u51fd\u6570\u7684\u793a\u4f8b\uff1a</p> <pre><code>int forLoop(int ...){\n    ...\n    for(int i=...;i&lt;=...;i++){\n        ...\n    }\n    ...\n    return ...;\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"blog/2026/07/09/%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%BA%A6%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/#1112-while","title":"1.1.1.2 <code>while\u5faa\u73af</code>","text":"<p><code>while\u5faa\u73af</code>\u4e5f\u662f\u4e00\u79cd\u5b9e\u73b0\u8fed\u4ee3\u7684\u65b9\u6cd5\u3002\u4e00\u822c\u6765\u8bb2\uff0c<code>while\u5faa\u73af</code>\u6bd4<code>for\u5faa\u73af</code>\u81ea\u7531\u5ea6\u66f4\u9ad8\u3002</p> <p>\u4e0b\u9762\u7684\u4ee3\u7801\u4e3a\u4e00\u4e2a\u5229\u7528<code>while\u5faa\u73af</code>\u5b9e\u73b0\u67d0\u9879\u529f\u80fd\u7684\u51fd\u6570\u7684\u793a\u4f8b\uff1a</p> <pre><code>int whileLoop(int ...){\n    ...\n    while(CONDITION){\n        ...\n    }\n    ...\n    return ...;\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"blog/2026/07/09/%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%BA%A6%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/#1113","title":"1.1.1.3 \u5d4c\u5957\u5faa\u73af","text":""},{"location":"blog/archive/2026/","title":"2026","text":""},{"location":"blog/category/test/","title":"test","text":""},{"location":"blog/category/%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%BA%A6/","title":"\u590d\u6742\u5ea6","text":""},{"location":"blog/category/hello-%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/","title":"Hello \u7b97\u6cd5","text":""},{"location":"blog/category/%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/","title":"\u7b97\u6cd5\u5b66\u4e60","text":""}]}